  "metadata": {
    "name": "mount_element_type_root_f32",
    "description": "A Float32 document mounting three leaves: the Float32 leaf (nothing to write), the leaf that declares nothing (adopts Float32, nothing to write) and the Float64 leaf (its variables carry Float64)."
